<hgroup><h1>NADP<sup>+</sup> Reduction with Reduced Ferredoxin and NADP<sup>+</sup> Reduction with NADH Are Coupled via an Electron-Bifurcating Enzyme Complex in <em>Clostridium kluyveri</em><sup><a href="#fn2" class="usa-link">▿</a></sup><sup> </sup>
